VS Code shortcuts

option+down arrow: move line down
shift+alt+down arrow: duplicate line down

option+left arrow: move cursor one word to left
shift+ command+ down arrow: multicursor down

cmd+D: select current word. If repeated then muticursor  all same words in file

shift+cmd+L add muticursor to end of word
shift+ctrl+righarrow: expand selection

cmd+shift+K : delete current line
cmd+x: cut selected, if not selected then cut current line
cmd+c: copy selected, if not selected then copy current line

WINDSURF

Accept suggestion: ⇥
Accept next word: ⌥→
Accept current line: ⌘→
Trigger suggestion: ⌥\



